# Live Long and Prosper {5}{W}{U}. Bot1 starts at 7 life so the doubling is exact: 14, not 7 more or 21 (CR 701.10d).
# "Draw cards equal to the number of cards in your hand" counts the hand before drawing (CR 608.2h): 6 cards become 12.
# "This spell can't be countered": Bot2's Counterspell resolves and does nothing (CR 101.2, 701.6a). "You have no maximum hand
# size until your next turn" (CR 514.2): the cleanup at the end of turn 5 keeps all 12 cards, and the cleanup at the end
# of turn 7 discards down to 7 - the effect ended when turn 7 began.

